'''Mistress Celeboodle''' (プドール夫人, ''Pudōru Fujin'', '''Lady Pudoll''') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant of [[Celeboodle]] that appears in the [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]] and [[Legend Stages]]. She was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]].

