==Enemy==
An enemy with powerful single attacks but mediocre health. She is a little bit annoying because her already high damage increases by 100% after reaching 75% HP and anything she hits is generally a lost cause. She drops quite a lot of money for how often and early she tends to spawn.

==Strategy==
As with the original, Mistress Celeboodle should be warded off by smaller meatshields so she cannot destroy any large units. Her single-target attacks allow them to stall her fairly easily. Despite her high damage, her low health and range can be easily exploited by various attackers, even when in swarms.

Do not underestimate her damage when strengthened. In certain [[Cats of the Cosmos]] stages she appears in, where she is buffed and restrictions prevent you from properly meatshielding, she can nuke attackers into oblivion.

[[:Category:Cats with Money Up ability|Cats with Money Up abilities]] are recommended to exploit her money drop.

